  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Tu camino&quot;:youth and adults opportunities for quality education continuity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This workplan will consist in the elaboration of a study on youth and adults&#xb4; current opportunities to continue education trajectories, mainly in rural and low-income areas. it will explore current opportunities, gaps and potential pathways for accessing and finalizing secondary education, as well as the continuity to TVET or other formal or non-formal education opportunities. The study will be done in collaboration with Ministries of Education of the cluster countries and other identified key stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
